# The ps2build SDK Launchstation builds with, pinned to exact releases (LLVM/Clang is the release toolchain).
#
# Build jobs never ask the official ps2build releases (github.com/ps2build) which release is newest. Every
# version below is pinned, so scripts/ps2build_sdk.sh --resolve makes no network calls: the SDK cached under
# these versions is restored, and only on a cache miss is anything installed: from the official GitHub
# releases first, then, when they fail, from the private NathanNeurotic/old-ps2build-mirror release named by
# PS2BUILD_SDK_TAG (its SHA256SUMS must hash to PS2BUILD_SDK_SUMS_SHA256). Claude Code cloud sessions install the same SDK (.claude/hooks/session-start.sh).
#
# Unpinned versions cost 9 release-API calls in every build, one per name below.
#
# .github/workflows/ps2build-sdk-watch.yml asks once a week (.github/scripts/ps2build_sdk_watch.py), from
# ps2build's release manifest (github.com/ps2build/manifest). When anything is newer it:
#   - caches the new SDK on master;
#   - opens a draft pull request that bumps the pins here, mirror release included.
#
# To keep a package on its current release (a broken upstream release), name it in PS2BUILD_SDK_HOLD: the
# weekly check then leaves it alone. Use the names below, plus llvm-toolchain.
# Editing a version by hand? Then also clear PS2BUILD_SDK_TAG and PS2BUILD_SDK_SUMS_SHA256 (the mirror
# fallback then takes the newest mirror release), unless that mirror release holds exactly the new versions.
# A bare component name (no =version) still works and follows the newest release, but it costs API calls in
# every build, so CI must not use it: .github/scripts/test_ps2build_sdk_watch.py fails on one.
PS2BUILD_SDK_MIRROR=NathanNeurotic/old-ps2build-mirror
PS2BUILD_SDK_TAG=sdk-v2026.11.07-cd4281a8
PS2BUILD_SDK_SUMS_SHA256=56f40717d2785c727ebef6e21afb7fc71e914ee3f468f6e45a30e551ffeedd4f
PS2BUILD_COMPONENTS="cmake=v2026.11.04 ninja=v1.13.2 ps2build=v2026.11.07 sdk-core=v2026.11.05 sdk-world=v2026.11.05 toolchain=v2026.11.04 tools=v2026.11.04 vcl=v2026.11.04"
PS2BUILD_LLVM_TOOLCHAIN=v2026.11.05
PS2BUILD_SDK_HOLD=""
